        "@value": "(i) Approved protocol, (ii) DTUA with CHUV, HUG, Insel and USB, and (iii) Approval of Main Project Leader Prof. Sabine Blum based on a joint decision with project parties. Contact: Sabine.Blum@chuv.ch"
      }
